{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"15179","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/15179","key":"MC-183784","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"13/May/20 9:49 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug\"></a>The Bug</h3>\n<p>When changing the window size while the menu is open, the icons appear glitched out</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce\"></a>Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bring up the gamemode switcher menu. (Hold F3 and press F4).</li>\n\t<li>Whilst still having this menu open, resize your game window.</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not gamemode switcher icons are duplicated after resizing your game window.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior\"></a>Observed Behavior</h3>\n\n<p>Gamemode switcher icons are duplicated after resizing your game window.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior\"></a>Expected Behavior</h3>\n\n<p>Gamemode switcher icons would not be duplicated after resizing your game window.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"13/May/20 6:05 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/24181","id":"24181","filename":"2020-05-13_18.42.41.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us